### =========================================================================
### Car Sharing API - Role-Based Access Control (Lecture 6)
### 3 Users:
###   1. user       / user123       (Role: USER)
###   2. admin      / admin123      (Role: ADMIN)
###   3. superadmin / superadmin123 (Role: SUPERADMIN)
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

###1. [USER] GET all vehicles (Allowed for USER, ADMIN, SUPERADMIN -> 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vehicles
Authorization: Basic user user123
Accept: application/json

###

###2. [USER] GET vehicle by ID (Allowed for USER, ADMIN, SUPERADMIN -> 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vehicles/1
Authorization: Basic user user123
Accept: application/json

###

###3. [USER] GET all fleets (Allowed for USER, ADMIN, SUPERADMIN -> 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fleets
Authorization: Basic user user123
Accept: application/json

###

###4. [USER] POST rent a vehicle (Allowed for USER, ADMIN, SUPERADMIN -> 200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vehicles/1/rent?userId=1
Authorization: Basic user user123
Accept: application/json

###

###5. [ADMIN] GET all users (Allowed for ADMIN, SUPERADMIN -> 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Accept: application/json

###

###6. [ADMIN] POST create a new vehicle (Allowed for ADMIN, SUPERADMIN -> 200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vehicles
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "3",
  "brand": "Hyundai",
  "model": "Ioniq 5",
  "registrationNumber": "CE7788EE",
  "fleetId": "1",
  "rentedByUserId": null
}

###

###7. [ADMIN] PUT update vehicle by ID (Allowed for ADMIN, SUPERADMIN -> 200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vehicles/3
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "3",
  "brand": "Hyundai",
  "model": "Ioniq 6",
  "registrationNumber": "CE7788EE",
  "fleetId": "1",
  "rentedByUserId": null
}

###

###8. [SUPERADMIN] POST create a new user (Allowed ONLY for SUPERADMIN -> 200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin123
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "2",
  "email": "marta.shevchenko@example.com",
  "fullName": "Marta Shevchenko",
  "driverLicense": "BX556677"
}

###

###9. [SUPERADMIN] PUT update user by ID (Allowed ONLY for SUPERADMIN -> 200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/2
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin123
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "2",
  "email": "marta.updated@example.com",
  "fullName": "Marta Shevchenko Updated",
  "driverLicense": "BX556677-NEW"
}

###

###10. [SUPERADMIN] DELETE user by ID (Allowed ONLY for SUPERADMIN -> 200 OK)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/2
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin123
Accept: application/json
